            <p style="border: black 1px dotted; background-color: #EEEEEE; padding: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px">Expansion performed internally based on 
              <a href="CodeSystem-CDSCv2.html">codesystem Classification of Digital Health Services and Application Types v2 v1.0.0 (CodeSystem)</a>
              <span class="copy-text-inline">
                <button data-clipboard-text="http://smart.who.int/base/CodeSystem/CDSCv2|1.0.0" title="Click to Copy URL" class="btn-copy"> </button>
