                  <code>http://smart.who.int/base/CodeSystem/CDSCv2</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-CDSCv2.html#CDSCv2-D5">D5</a>
                </td>
                <td>Geographic information systems (GIS)</td>
                <td>Systems that capture, analyse and visualise geospatial health data for mapping health events, facilities, and populations.</td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;http://smart.who.int/base/CodeSystem/CDSCv2&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;1.0.0&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;D5&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Geographic information systems (GIS)&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
