                  <a href="CodeSystem-CDSCv2.html#CDSCv2-D6">D6</a>
                </td>
                <td>Health Management Information systems (HMIS)</td>
                <td>Systems for aggregate health data reporting, target-setting, and programme monitoring, typically at district and national levels.</td>
